  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Answering the Call to Action (ACA) Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ACA programme is a 5-months bridging programme to support humanitarian assistance in North East Nigeria of about &#xa3;15m. The programme will provide life-saving support to the most vulnerable and develop foundations for building multi-level resilience by the next humanitarian programme</narrative>
  </description>
